      ],
      "text": "Drawn from Fuzz Central's \"Sola Sound ToneBender Professional MKII\"\nschematic, traced from an original (5µF, 0.01µF, 100K, 10K, 0.1µF,\n100K, 8K2, 470, Level 100KA, Attack 1KB with 5µF; \"Transistors were\nOC81D PNP Germanium\"). Part numbers are Solum Builder's.\nhttp://fuzzcentral.ssguitar.com/mkII.php"
    }
  ]
